### Try the API from VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension,
### then click "Send Request" above each request.

### Is the server and database working?
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### List boards
GET http://localhost:3000/api/boards

### Create a board
POST http://localhost:3000/api/boards
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "My first API board" }

### Get a board's columns and cards (replace BOARD_ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/boards/BOARD_ID/columns

### Add a card to a column (replace COLUMN_ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/columns/COLUMN_ID/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Write the API" }

### Update a card (replace CARD_ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/cards/CARD_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "priority": "High", "dueDate": "2026-11-20" }

### Move a card to another column, first position (replace the IDs)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cards/CARD_ID/move
Content-Type: application/json

{ "columnId": "COLUMN_ID", "position": 0 }
